<title>USA: INDOSAT AT 30-5/8 IN NEW YORK ON WEDNESDAY.</title>
<headline>INDOSAT AT 30-5/8 IN NEW YORK ON WEDNESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Indonesian Satellite Corporation (Indosat) closed at 30-5/8 in New York on Wednesday. It recorded the day's low of 30 and the day's high of 31.</p>
<p>Volume was 69,700 American Depository Shares. Block volume was 35,600. Its previous close on Tuesday was 31-3/16.</p>
<p>One ADS represents 10 common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
</text>
